sequenceDiagram
  participant DA as dashboard AppContext
  participant SO as socket.io-client :3000
  participant IO as backend index.js Server
  participant NS as notificationSocket.js
  participant TS as tournamentService

  DA->>SO: connect after currentUser
  DA->>IO: emit join-user-room userId
  Note over IO: No JWT check on join
  IO->>IO: socket.join user:userId
  DA->>IO: emit join-tournament-room tournamentId
  IO->>IO: socket.join tournament:id

  NS->>IO: io.to user:id emit new-notification
  IO->>DA: new-notification
  NS->>DA: notification:updated deleted read-all

  TS->>IO: io.to tournament:id emit tournament-leaderboard-update
  IO->>DA: PaperTrading live ranks

  Note over DA: Quotes are NOT socket events
  DA->>DA: GET /api/market/prices every 5s
